{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":21.92},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.36,"end":38.32},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.92,"end":52}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.2,"text":"這個實驗比較兩種缺值規則：排除缺失週，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.52,"end":6.64,"text":"或補成零。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.76,"end":9.44,"text":"原始表格保持不變，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.84,"end":12.24,"text":"有效列數顯示平均的分母。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.8,"end":16.08,"text":"此處沒有刪除重複列功能。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":17.12,"end":21.92,"text":"缺少數字不自動等於零：兩者意義不同。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.36,"end":24,"text":"切換清理，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.4,"end":26.88,"text":"比較接受的筆數與摘要。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.76,"end":30.24,"text":"說明規則排除了哪些紀錄，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.52,"end":33.92,"text":"而不是把結果當成自動正確。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":35.24,"end":38.32,"text":"為何不能總把缺值改成零？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.92,"end":43.04,"text":"為何不能總把缺值改成零？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.16,"end":48.32,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":49.12,"end":52,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}